      "description": "实际渲染背景覆盖整页，从上到下逐渐加深，两端都保持浅色并与热力图浅蓝灰配色协调。",
      "weight": 8,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "professional_readiness",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "score_cap_on_failure": 0
